                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.51/222: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Salvador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hewes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-12-28T12:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 28,
                                1922—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received December 29—12:12
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>120. This Government accepted and signed the terms of the New York Bankers and
                    Mr. Keith yesterday thereby concluding the loan negotiations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hewes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
